          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "झड़प — jhaṛap — \"a scuffle; a skirmish\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "बाज़ार में दो दुकानदारों के बीच झड़प हुई। bāzār meṁ do dukāndāroṁ ke bīc jhaṛap huī. A scuffle broke out between two shopkeepers in the market."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Feminine."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "is set by CDIAL under jhaṭ, a form it reconstructs for quick, sudden movements (CDIAL 5327), where it gives Hindi jhaṛap, a fight: the same family as झटका, a jolt. A झड़प is short and sudden, between two people or two small groups."
            }
          ]
        },
